      "const": "BR13 accepts only the exact BR13.0, BR13.2, and BR13.4 milestone program claim scopes in certification br13_20260723T225845Z_897b93c2 at source commit 897b93c2c1094081dd2cf411b99f967770d8c0bc. BR13.1 and BR13.3 remain integrity-only. The certification report's verbatim claim boundary, exact symmetry-collapsed profile, material sagittal guide, seed set, matched zero-command controls, finite paired actuation, transition-integrated energy account, guide bounds, exclusive stance handoff, and stable terminal dwell remain controlling. The accepted result is exactly constrained_planar_get_up for this fixture; it is not free-3D or morphology-generalized recovery, independent four-limb control, general standing or bracing, a step, gait, or walking."
